Java Backend Project – Step-by-Step Using Spring Boot
I think you mean a Spring Boot project using Java for backend development.

Let's start from the basics and build a complete Java backend project step by step, from project creation to execution and testing APIs.

Since you are learning Java development, I recommend starting with a Student Management System. It is a good beginner-to-intermediate project and covers the main concepts used in real-time company projects.
1. Project we are going to build
Student Management System
Java Backend REST API Project
Beginner friendly


Technology stack
Technology	      Purpose
Java	          Backend programming
Spring Boot	    Backend framework
Spring Web	    Create REST APIs
Spring Data JPA	Database operations
MySQL	          Store student details
Maven	          Dependency management
Postman	        Test APIs
IntelliJ IDEA / VS Code	Code editor


